{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さ、寒い..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こないだまで、すごく暑かったのにね、(´･-･`)\n最近は、一気に涼しくなって\n寒いのが苦手な私は、とにかく温かいものに\n縋っている毎日です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は、部屋で暖房をつけて\n三角座りでブログを書いています（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コーンポタージュがなぜか美味しい季節ッ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急な気温の変化に、身体崩さないように\n皆さんも、気をつけてください(>_<)ぺこり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日は、大阪個別握手会に来てくださった皆さん\n有難うございました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかった～(o^^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に有難う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やはり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"関西弁すっきゃ（ ＾-＾ ）"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、若月ブログのタイトルに\nまたなってしまいましたが(´･_･`; )\n今日は、大阪ということで\n大阪名物の肉まんを食べたんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぐもぐ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく美味しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルはせいたんと部屋が\n一緒でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の家から、でっかい目覚まし時計を\n持ってきたせいたんに、\nす、すごいねぇ...(･_･;\nと、ビックリしつつも、\nうちらこれで早起き完璧だね！\nって言ってたんです（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、ホテル着いたら二人とも眠くて\nうとうとしちゃって..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"せいたん「先にお風呂入ってくるね( ´ ▽ ` )ウトウト...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わたし「じゃあ少し寝てるから、お風呂出てきたら\n起こして？( ´ - ` )ウトウト...」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言って、すぐに眠ってしまい..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのままいつまでも起こされることはなく、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分で気がついて起きたら、\nせいたんも、となりで寝てて（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あれっΣ（・□・；）\nせいたんお風呂入ってないじゃんヽ(；▽；)ノ！笑  って"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう、ゆるい2人が揃うと大変でした（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、楽しい夜だったし、\n早起きもしっかりできてよかったよかった(*^o^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな感じで、楽しい旅にもなったし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に 有難うございました＼(^o^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは、\nおやすみなさゆにゃん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さゆにゃんヽ(｡･ω･｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/sayuri.inoue/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/09/24/2448290/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}